::::: frame
### Definitions

::: block
Overcompensation Density-dependent response in which populations over-
or under-shoot carrying capacity rather than approach it gradually
:::

::: block
Chaos Highly variable deterministic dynamics that are extremely
sensitive to small changes in parameters
:::
:::::

::: frame
### Assumptions of basic model

- $K$ and $r_{max}$ are constant

- No sex or age effects or other sources of individual heterogeneity

- No time lags

- No stochasticity
:::

